{"id":"u-79ab6d8f-740a-4bc2-8fe1-d5b45a35dff8","src":"community","title":"Strength and posture","author":"Ran D.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/PZUZ0z-strength-and-posture","desc":"Engineered around a strict 2:1 pull-to-push volume ratio, this 3-day full-body routine is a joint-friendly, 45-minute blueprint designed to reverse desk fatigue, fix forward-slouched posture, and eliminate shoulder imbalances. By trading out rigid barbells for dumbbells, cables, and bodyweight hangs, the program targets vital stabilizing systems like the lower traps, rear delts, and posterior chain to ensure symmetrical muscular development. It prioritizes slow tempos, spinal decompression, and intentional isometric squeezes rather than training to failure, making it the perfect foundational routine to safely rebuild total-body alignment and long-term joint health after a layoff.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":9,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-17T14:54:24.591Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Tib Raises","sets":[{"r":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Wall Press Dead Bug","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2},{"r":0}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Step-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Inverted Row","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Face Pull","sets":[{"r":20,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Floor Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Farmer's Walk (Weighted)","sets":[{"sec":45,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dead Hang","sets":[{"sec":45,"x":3}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Tib Raises","sets":[{"r":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"Squat (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Wall Press Dead Bug","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2},{"r":0}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Step-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":15,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Inverted Row","sets":[{"r